<title>USA: Insight to offer 1.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Insight to offer 1.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>TEMPE, Ariz. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insight Enterprises Inc said on Thursday it filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a proposed public offering of 1,526,250 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The company will offer 1,000,000 common shares with thw balanced offered by certain selling stockholders.</p>
<p>The offering is being managed by Montgomery Securities, Lazard Freres &amp; Co and Piper Jaffray Inc.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it plans to use the net proceeds from the sale of its shares for general corporate purposes to facilitate its planned growth.</p>
</text>
